  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br>기후변화주간 홍보를 위해<br>환경동아리 아이들과 점심시간에<br>게릴라 퀴즈 시간을 만들었네요.<br>&#160;<br>퀴즈 문제를 피켓으로&#160;만들어<br>들고 다니면서<br>퀴즈 정답을 말하는 아이들에게<br>사탕 주기 행사를 했어요.<br>&#160;<br>사탕 하나에 목숨 거는 아이들이 있기에<br>신이 납니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e86ab738d036c58c530f881c62e10a5ebd556bf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e86ab738d036c58c530f881c62e10a5ebd556bf\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e540f385b4aed970703f0c09ec8257b58cb97be0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e540f385b4aed970703f0c09ec8257b58cb97be0\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">씨앗 나눔 행사 홍보물도 아이들이 만들었어요.<br>&#160;<br>씨앗은 약포지에 넣어 주었습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9a1bf0a0226dd6b9d2b6e9ab2fb1e14e3de7d6f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9a1bf0a0226dd6b9d2b6e9ab2fb1e14e3de7d6f\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/80a073e636764a0cff04c1340d514ac68118bb88\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/80a073e636764a0cff04c1340d514ac68118bb88\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>신청한 씨앗을 나누어 주면서<br>지난 달 어스아워 참가자들에게 주는 선물인<br>대나무 칫솔 증정식도 함께 했는데..<br>즐거웠어요.<br>우수 인증샷을 올린 친구들에게는<br>자석 양치컵도 함께 줬어요.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74d6eb3124aa4f56881e942894cd78419a3cf1b8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74d6eb3124aa4f56881e942894cd78419a3cf1b8\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e02f3ce214ebc7598c3d5bd65e33872c7880e834\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e02f3ce214ebc7598c3d5bd65e33872c7880e834\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be8c63ffbb32fb35953a477b4977fd4188e742b1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be8c63ffbb32fb35953a477b4977fd4188e742b1\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/979678b595f6025bda5c92d2680593d57f122801\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/979678b595f6025bda5c92d2680593d57f122801\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">박수치면서 신나는 분위기 만들며<br>칫솔 증정식을 했어요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fcb096b839c81fcc56ff9c849e5fd4f533806a87\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fcb096b839c81fcc56ff9c849e5fd4f533806a87\" data-origin-width=\"1078\" data-origin-height=\"822\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
